  "descriptionHtml": "<div class=\"product-highlights\" style=\"margin-bottom:16px;\"><span style=\"display:inline-block;background:#f3f4f6;color:#1f2937;padding:3px 10px;border-radius:12px;font-size:12px;margin:2px 4px 2px 0;font-weight:500;\">✓ Unisex/Genderless Scent</span><span style=\"display:inline-block;background:#f3f4f6;color:#1f2937;padding:3px 10px;border-radius:12px;font-size:12px;margin:2px 4px 2px 0;font-weight:500;\">✓ Fresh Scent</span><span style=\"display:inline-block;background:#f3f4f6;color:#1f2937;padding:3px 10px;border-radius:12px;font-size:12px;margin:2px 4px 2px 0;font-weight:500;\">✓ Layerable Scent</span></div>\n<div class=\"product-description-main\" style=\"margin-bottom:20px;line-height:1.6;\"><p><strong>Fragrance Family:</strong> Fresh</p><p><br></p><p><strong>Scent Type:</strong> Fresh Florals</p><p><br></p><p><strong>Key Notes:</strong> Ylang-Ylang, Apricot Skin, Ambrox</p><p><br></p><p><strong>Fragrance Description:</strong> Glossier You Fleur is an airy and luminous floral blended perfume. This fresh scent opens with a salty Mineral Salt Accord, leading into a heart of velvety Apricot Skin and an exquisite blend of new blooms—fuzzy Osmanthus and creamy Ylang Ylang— accented by woody Cashmeran, all balanced by a warm, musky base driven by Ambrox.</p></div>\n<details class=\"size-guide-accordion\" style=\"margin-top:16px;border-top:1px solid #e5e7eb;padding-top:12px;\"><summary style=\"font-weight:600;font-size:15px;cursor:pointer;padding:6px 0;outline:none;display:flex;justify-content:space-between;align-items:center;\"><span>How to Use</span><span style=\"font-size:18px;color:#6b7280;\">+</span></summary><div style=\"padding:12px 0 6px 0;line-height:1.6;color:#374151;\"><p style=\" border-box; outline: 0px; padding: 0px; margin: 0px; color: rgb(26, 32, 40); font-family: Montserrat, Helvetica, Arial, sans-serif; font-size: 12px; font-style: normal; font-variant-ligatures: normal; font-variant-caps: normal; font-weight: 400; letter-spacing: normal; orphans: 2; text-align: start; text-indent: 0px; text-transform: none; widows: 2; word-spacing: 0px; -webkit-text-stroke-width: 0px; white-space: pre-wrap; background-color: rgb(255, 255, 255); text-decoration-thickness: initial; text-decoration-style: initial; text-decoration-color: initial;\" ><strong style=\" border-box; outline: 0px;\">Suggested Usage:<br style=\" border-box; outline: 0px;\"></strong></p><p style=\" border-box; outline: 0px; padding: 0px; margin: 0px; color: rgb(26, 32, 40); font-family: Montserrat, Helvetica, Arial, sans-serif; font-size: 12px; font-style: normal; font-variant-ligatures: normal; font-variant-caps: normal; font-weight: 400; letter-spacing: normal; orphans: 2; text-align: start; text-indent: 0px; text-transform: none; widows: 2; word-spacing: 0px; -webkit-text-stroke-width: 0px; white-space: pre-wrap; background-color: rgb(255, 255, 255); text-decoration-thickness: initial; text-decoration-style: initial; text-decoration-color: initial;\">- Spray scent as desired on your pulse points (your neck, behind your ears, your wrists, and more)&nbsp;</p><p style=\" border-box; outline: 0px; padding: 0px; margin: 0px; color: rgb(26, 32, 40); font-family: Montserrat, Helvetica, Arial, sans-serif; font-size: 12px; font-style: normal; font-variant-ligatures: normal; font-variant-caps: normal; font-weight: 400; letter-spacing: normal; orphans: 2; text-align: start; text-indent: 0px; text-transform: none; widows: 2; word-spacing: 0px; -webkit-text-stroke-width: 0px; white-space: pre-wrap; background-color: rgb(255, 255, 255); text-decoration-thickness: initial; text-decoration-style: initial; text-decoration-color: initial;\">- Allow fragrance to settle for a few moments rather than rubbing it in (as this can disrupt the scent)&nbsp;</p><p style=\" border-box; outline: 0px; padding: 0px; margin: 0px; color: rgb(26, 32, 40); font-family: Montserrat, Helvetica, Arial, sans-serif; font-size: 12px; font-style: normal; font-variant-ligatures: normal; font-variant-caps: normal; font-weight: 400; letter-spacing: normal; orphans: 2; text-align: start; text-indent: 0px; text-transform: none; widows: 2; word-spacing: 0px; -webkit-text-stroke-width: 0px; white-space: pre-wrap; background-color: rgb(255, 255, 255); text-decoration-thickness: initial; text-decoration-style: initial; text-decoration-color: initial;\">- Apply post-shower, after moisturizing to aid absorption for a longer, stronger scent impact</p></div></details>\n<details class=\"size-guide-accordion\" style=\"margin-top:12px;border-top:1px solid #e5e7eb;border-bottom:1px solid #e5e7eb;padding:12px 0;\"><summary style=\"font-weight:600;font-size:15px;cursor:pointer;padding:6px 0;outline:none;display:flex;justify-content:space-between;align-items:center;\"><span>Ingredients</span><span style=\"font-size:18px;color:#6b7280;\">+</span></summary><div style=\"padding:12px 0 6px 0;line-height:1.6;color:#374151;font-size:13px;\">Alcohol Denat., Water/Aqua/Eau, Fragrance/Parfum, Tetramethyl Acetyloctahydronaphthalenes, Hexamethylindanopyran, Benzyl Salicylate, Juniperus Virginiana Oil, Cananga Odorata Oil/Extract, Santalum Album Oil, Linalyl Acetate, Linalool, Hydroxycitronellal, Coumarin, Vanillin, Geraniol, Hexadecanolactone, Geranyl Acetate, Santalol, Beta-Caryophyllene, Pinene, Limonene, Rose Ketones.</div></details>",
  "description_html": "<div class=\"product-highlights\" style=\"margin-bottom:16px;\"><span style=\"display:inline-block;background:#f3f4f6;color:#1f2937;padding:3px 10px;border-radius:12px;font-size:12px;margin:2px 4px 2px 0;font-weight:500;\">✓ Unisex/Genderless Scent</span><span style=\"display:inline-block;background:#f3f4f6;color:#1f2937;padding:3px 10px;border-radius:12px;font-size:12px;margin:2px 4px 2px 0;font-weight:500;\">✓ Fresh Scent</span><span style=\"display:inline-block;background:#f3f4f6;color:#1f2937;padding:3px 10px;border-radius:12px;font-size:12px;margin:2px 4px 2px 0;font-weight:500;\">✓ Layerable Scent</span></div>\n<div class=\"product-description-main\" style=\"margin-bottom:20px;line-height:1.6;\"><p><strong>Fragrance Family:</strong> Fresh</p><p><br></p><p><strong>Scent Type:</strong> Fresh Florals</p><p><br></p><p><strong>Key Notes:</strong> Ylang-Ylang, Apricot Skin, Ambrox</p><p><br></p><p><strong>Fragrance Description:</strong> Glossier You Fleur is an airy and luminous floral blended perfume. This fresh scent opens with a salty Mineral Salt Accord, leading into a heart of velvety Apricot Skin and an exquisite blend of new blooms—fuzzy Osmanthus and creamy Ylang Ylang— accented by woody Cashmeran, all balanced by a warm, musky base driven by Ambrox.</p></div>\n<details class=\"size-guide-accordion\" style=\"margin-top:16px;border-top:1px solid #e5e7eb;padding-top:12px;\"><summary style=\"font-weight:600;font-size:15px;cursor:pointer;padding:6px 0;outline:none;display:flex;justify-content:space-between;align-items:center;\"><span>How to Use</span><span style=\"font-size:18px;color:#6b7280;\">+</span></summary><div style=\"padding:12px 0 6px 0;line-height:1.6;color:#374151;\"><p style=\" border-box; outline: 0px; padding: 0px; margin: 0px; color: rgb(26, 32, 40); font-family: Montserrat, Helvetica, Arial, sans-serif; font-size: 12px; font-style: normal; font-variant-ligatures: normal; font-variant-caps: normal; font-weight: 400; letter-